 "designerNotes": [
  "First Name and Last Name as two Form Field instances placed side by side in a horizontal auto-layout row. Desktop uses the Desktop size, 16px gap, each resized to half width (~232px). \n\nMobile uses the Mobile size, an 8px gap, each resized to half width (~160px) - see the smaller sample at right. \n\nOn a very narrow viewport, stack the two fields instead of placing them side by side. Each field's own error message space is hidden, so one shared error area spans the full row width below both fields instead of reserving blank error space twice."
